mat="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAGAI, AKIRA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKEMURA, KENZO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WATANABE, ITSUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WATANABE, OSAMU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An adhesive for bonding and securing a semiconductor chip to a circuit board and electrically connecting the electrodes of the two, and containing 100 parts by weight of an adhesive resin composition and 10 to 200 parts by weight of an adhesive resin composition and 10 to 200 parts by weight of an inorganic filler; a circuit board in which the circuit members are bonded together with the adhesive, and a method of producing the circuit board.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un adhésif servant à coller et fixer une microplaquette semi-conductrice sur une carte de circuit imprimé, et à connecter les électrodes de la microplaquette et de la carte. L'adhésif contient 100 % en poids d'une composition de résine adhésive et 10 à 200 % en poids d'une matière de charge inorganique. L'invention concerne en outre une carte de circuit imprimé dans laquelle les éléments de circuit sont fixés ensemble au moyen de l'adhésif, et un procédé de production de ladite carte de circuit imprimé.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.i